#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calligrastage.appdata.xml:9
msgid ""
"Calligra Stage is an easy to use yet still flexible presentation application."
" You can easily create presentations containing a rich variety of elements,"
" from graphics to text, from charts to images. Calligra Stage is extensible"
" through a plugin system, so it is easy to add new effects, new content"
" elements or even new ways of managing your presentation. Because of the"
" integration with Calligra, all the power and flexibility of the Calligra"
" content elements are available to Stage."
msgstr ""

